Subject: [PATCH] Correct pricing, questionnaire copy, and version drift

- Pricing: MBTI Basic R0->R30, Comprehensive R30->R50, Recruiter R50->R100
- Instructions: '10-15 minutes' -> 'less than 10 minutes' (60 questions)
- Add instinctive-answer instruction
- Add 24-hour report delivery copy on thank-you page
- Reconcile version string drift (7.5/7.6/7.7 -> 7.8) across api/index.ts, CONVERGE_SETTINGS.json, and admin dashboard

No changes to questionnaire, scoring, MBTI/Big Five/EI methodology, report generation, product routing, or email delivery logic. Admin password fallback left untouched pending Vercel env var verification.
